## The interface surface

`host/datamodel/api_surface.json` is a machine-readable list of class and property
names, used to decide which members this host is expected to accept. It is
GENERATED, NOT AUTHORED, and it is not distributed with this repository -- see
`.gitignore`. `scripts/fetch_api_surface.luau` regenerates it locally from a
published interface dump.

Names of classes, properties and types are factual descriptions of an interface
rather than creative expression, and are used solely for interoperability.

