### Luau packages built into dew

The bundled dashboard and quick panel are built into the `dew` executable
together with the Luau packages they require, as `pesde install` places them in
each applet's `roblox_packages/`. Dew writes them to disk unmodified beside the
applet that requires them. They are not covered by `LICENSE`. Each is under the
MIT License. Its full text is a file in the package (`vide/LICENSE.md`,
`aether/LICENSE`), so it is embedded and written with the code it covers.

| Package | Bundled with | Copyright | Licence |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| vide, installed from the `es9-dev/vide` fork | dashboard, quick panel | Copyright (c) 2022 centau | MIT License |
| aether | dashboard | Copyright (c) 2026 es9 | MIT License |
| virtual | dashboard | Copyright (c) 2026 es9 | MIT License |

`virtual` is a package from the aether repository, installed as an aether
